  typo
    defined-by concept
    role typo_fix_lead
    precondition "a request names a misspelled word in a file without stating its correction"
    effect "the word is corrected to the unique most frequent known word one edit away"
    unit "not applicable"
    example "fix the typo"
    lexeme en typo
    lexeme ru опечатку опечатка
    lexeme hi "वर्तनी की गलती"
    lexeme zh 错别字 拼写错误
    lexeme es errata "error ortográfico"
  coding_text_remove
    defined-by action
    role coding_text_remove_action
    precondition "a coding request names quoted text and the file it should leave"
    effect "the requested operation is bound to removing that text from the file"
    unit "not applicable"
    example "delete the line"
    lexeme en delete remove "get rid of"
    lexeme ru удали удалить убери убрать сотри
    lexeme hi हटाओ हटाएं मिटाओ
